$ sqlr set-global maybe
exit code: 2
--- stdout

Usage:   sqlr set-global <enabled>
Version: *                   

Description:

  Toggle global mode (true = ignore git repository scope, false = use repository scope)

Options:

  -h, --help    - Show this help.                                                 
  --debug       - Enable debug logs                                               
  -g, --global  - Use global scope for connections (ignore git repository scope)  

--- stderr
  error: Argument "enabled" must be of type "boolean", but got "maybe". Expected values: "true", "false", "1", "0"


